॥ yatidharmabodhinivyākhyā ॥

உ
śrīsundaragaṇapataye namaḥ

śrīmahāgaṇapataye namaḥ
(i.3b, l.1)
yatidharmaprabodhini
śivamastu
(l.2) viśvejanmāyavaṃ dhunḍiṃ daṇḍapāṇiṃ ca bhairavam ।
vandekāśiṅguhāṅgaṃgāṃ bhavānīrmaṇikarṇikām ॥
śrīkāntamukhyasāra (l.3) deśikadeśikendraṃ vāṇīpa...karūṇaṃ vacanaṃ niṣanmya । dikṣāvatīrṇīmavanaukalikalmaṣadhnaṃ śrīśaṃkarārdhamakhilātma (l.4) guruṃ namāmi evañca prākbhārāsahiṣṇvā...jyāyācitena śrīnāradamuninā sardhaṃ pitāmahavarjāpitaḥ parameśvara (l.5) eva svaraṃśenadiṣṭyāvanau mānavamūrtyā śrīśaṃkarabhāratināmnā vatatāretyabhiyuktasūktestanmahāguruvandanameva sakalatīrtha (l.6) vandanamāsiditvāśayaḥ śrūyate hiyogaśikhopuniṣadi gururbrahmā guruviṣṇurgururdevassadāśivaṃ naguroradhikaḥ kañciktriṣulo (l.7) .......nivṛjñānopadeṣṭārandeśikaṃ parameśvaraṃ । pūjayetparadhātatyāsamyak
(i.4a, l.1)
jñā.. phalaṃ labhediti । ...svātmaguruvandanamācaṣṭe । śrīkāśikānagaramadhyagave...kaṭe śadivyālaye nivartaḥ (l.2) karuṇāṇavasya । śrīnuśaṃkarandraminaścaraṇā..sevī śrīnilakaṇḍayatirātmabhīriṃ pūṇaumi । ātmaguruṃ svasyatatvopadeṣṭāraṃ (l.3) āṇatmavānugrahātmagurumīrthā virbhūtamiti vā namaḥ parama..bhyo namaḥ paramaṣṭibhyaḥ ihakhalupuṇyabhūmi tayāprasiddhahiṃ (l.4) dusthānīyamahadṛmaṇḍanāyamāna śrīkāśikāpurikṛtāvatārāṇāmanekaviścit kulagameṇānānmahārāṣṭabhākāve (l.5) kavatāṃbhiṇḍopanāmakasudhākarasūrivadhyāṇāṃ kauṇḍinyagotrajā nāmatmajena nīlakaṇṭhavipaścitā viracitāyāṃ traivaṇika (l.6) dharmaprakāśikāyāṃ pañcāśaduttaratrisahasra paritāyāṃ śrībhāgavatavyakhyāra amālāyāñcā ājñānavairāgyabalena
(i.4b, l.1)
pāramahaṃ hṛṃ praviṣṭenānena śrīmachśaṃkarayatīndra nideśena punaśrutiśirohṛdayaṃ gamāmṛdupadalalitāyati dharmā...dhīnīyaṃ (l.2) nibandhyate । yatravaidikamaryādā vidropa brahmaṇānvitā samūlāsukhabodhāsāyatise vyānahitā । yatreti yasminnibandhane vica...(l.3) māṇe srutyācārapaddhati stadupabrahmaṇaiḥ paratmaskāndādi purāṇaiḥ pārāśaryādrupapurāṇairsodhāyanādi kalpasūtraiścālā (l.4) kṛtāsāhisamalā śrutyativyajyamānā...prakāśaka nibajanasya sahisamaletvaṃ kalpasūtrāṇāṃ tu purividāṃgotrakāṇāṃ pramitatvāt prāmāṇyameva (l.5) yaditatrakasyacidvicikitsā tadācārabhraṃśāktasya brāhmaṇyamapisandihyate kimutaviśvādhikaridramahadvi praṇitapurāṇānāṃ (l.6) nahikādaṃ baryādi svatantraprabadhyasya nirmūletvāt prāmāṇya...kṛyata itusamūlaivayatisevyetyaḥ । sukhabodhācaśāntānāṃ sukhenabo...(l.7) śatyāca sālaṃkārāpyanyāvidyaiveti śrūyate hi । parivrājakaśrūtau nāsaścāstreṣu sajjetanopajivetajivikāṃ ativādāntyaje
(i.5a, l.1)
dajyā..nu pakṣaṃ kañcananāśraye ...brahmagītāsu vidyāssarkhānṛṇāṃ sākṣāt saṃsārasyapravartakāḥ ātmavidyātusaṃsāratamasaḥ (l.2) pratipātijati athānubandhaca duṣṭayaṃ vyajayati । yomahāpuruṣārthe...ryomahādevabhāvanaḥ mahārṇavarāgyaliṅgaṃca(l.3) yaktesapuruṣottamaḥ yastu dharmādyatradhāṇāsukhaleśātāsadukhottaratvena vicāryamumukṣurevatavatraśrīyate (l.4) maitreyo..ṣadavarṇāśramācārayutāhi mūḍhāḥ karmānurūpeṇa phalaṃlavinte । varṇādidharmaṃ tu paratyajantasvānandatraptāḥ (l.5) puruṣābhavaṃtīti । nirālaṃbaśritau mahāpuruṣoya..t samayyevāvatiṣṭhate hañcatasminniti । tanmumukṣaivaprāpye.... । (l.6) tatopimahādevaṃ yojyāyatimukyaṃtaraṃ gasāyanatvāduttama iti । yyānenaparameṇasyasāṃbamūrtidharasya ca suniṣkalapanijānaṃ (l.7) jāyate nānyahetunā iti । tatophamahāvairāgyaliṅgaṃ pāramahaṃsyaṃ prāptayāt tapasovāpyaliṃ...ditya....phaṇā āhuḥ ।
(i.5b, l.1)
tatpūrvoktamumukṣutvaśivajyātrabayossatvepi vairāgyaliṅgābhāvenasākṣāmuktissidyattisadhaḥ । atha prakṛtamavatārayati । śivekakathitaṃ bhikṣu (l.2) lakṣaṇādipurākila । atriyogisamutthpāyatriṇetrāṃśāya yogine । tadyasaṃgraheṇāhaṃ bruveguruparāyaṇaḥ । sarvaśratyasāreṇasuśretrasukhadaṃ (l.3) budhāḥ । śiveti purāśivenamūlaguruṇāduṣāsasebhikṣulakṣaṇādi tatsaṃskārāntamuttaṃ athañcaśaivasanyāsavidhiñcakremuniśvaraḥ । (l.4) atriputrothadūṣāsāśśiṣyesyañcopadiṣṭavānityādinātadevādya suśohanārdha śravaṇā...nāmasukhadaṃ buve । (l.5) nanujaḍabhara...yodi karmandiṣcanekeṣu kutaśśāpāyudhasyāsya manemūpadeśaprapañcanamitācet sakyaṃ itare...naḥ (l.6) padhyameva anyatraivaṃ vidhopakramādiliṅgadhākalyā ... kiñcā brahmacārīśrahasthaścavāna prasthaścahikṣukaḥ । catvāra āśramāṇate prathagācāralakṣaṇāḥ । (l.7) eṣā...tvāromunaye pravagārakāḥ । dadhīcogautamogasyodurṣāsāścayathākramamitiṃ taktadāśramapravarttakā
(i.6a, l.1)
mtraṃ niruyya du...ya..maprāśrame...tohare iti śivavacanatastadāśramapravarttakatvā tadupadiṣṭāyyaivaprāmāṇyamiti api ca (l.2) śāpāyudhāvastahyata ...... meva tīṣāsmādvātanmatyādaśratyāparaśivasya brahmaṇodayahetutvaṃ tathā tathā smāpitiyujyate । tasmā...tyanusāriṇā (l.3) kālikhaṇḍavidhināsanyaśramapraveśakadācāratakasaṃskārādi lakṣaṇameva mumukṣuti rāgaraṇiyamiti siddhati । sanyāse...ktatvā (l.4) ścaiva ityabhidhīyate । vedātaśatamūlatvādvaidikaśrauta ityapi । ayaṃ paramahaṃsadharmaḥ vedāntapratipādyatvāścivopadiṣṭatvācca vaidikasanyāsa vidhiḥ । (l.5) śrautaśaiva... pikahyate mahat hirityatthaḥ । ata eva brahmacaryādyā śramaṇasthammumukṣubhiḥ praravṛmavetyanthaḥ । nanuṣurmanneve (l.6) ekarmāṇijijīviṣa..taṃ samā iti śrutiḥ karmaṇaṇavahisaṃsiddhimā sthitājanakādaya iti cagārhasthenāpi mokṣelabdha..kutoja (l.7) badhirādyā śrayaṇiyakarmatyāgasyāsya mokṣahetutvamiticet jijīviṣeditiśadaisāmarthyāddehāmimāni na eva nuṣṭhānavidhiḥ । nahimumukṣorityaparitā
(i.6b, l.1)
..suddhānāmatelokaṃ iti tannindāvacanādyajyate । bhagavadupadiṣṭajanakādinidarśanaṃ tu prakṛta prakriyopayogiti mantavyaṃ । yadyanyathā yadicśanto (l.2) brahmacaryancarajītateva dusaṃgraheṇa bravīmīti vacanasyānavasara eva । tatassanyāsa eva sukhadaḥ vedāntavijñānasuniścitādyā ssannyāsayogaditi । (l.3) yadāsaphe pramucyante kāmāyesyahṛdiśritāḥ athamatyomṛtobhavatīti । eṣāntapo brahmacaryameya...satyaṃ pratimateṃ teṣāmasau virajo (l.4) brahmaloka iti pravṛjiṣya... are ahaḥ smāsthānādityādi śrutahaḥ paramasādhanatayarasanyāsa eva svakartavyaḥ । parīkṣyalokān (l.5) karmacitānu brāhmaṇo viratiṃ bhajet । kramenakarmaṇā mokṣasva kṛtonahisaṃbhavet । karmaṇāracitān prakṛvittakrahādi..saṃskṛ(l.6)... reṇasamyak parikṣyapa...locya virako bhavet yogopaniṣadi āpadaḥkṣaṇamāya...kṣaṇamāyāntisaṃpadaḥ kṣa...nmā (l.7)dhamaraṇaṃ sarpadna...sahidhastanaḥ pūrvapī..nnipīmya..śṛte । yasmājajātogagāt pūrvantasminnecabhageramarna evaṃ saṃsāracakreyaṃ kūrca
(i.7a, l.1)
cakre dhaṭājapeti mahopaniṣadi । kāloyaṃ sarpasyaṃhārīte nātrānatrājagakṛyaṃ duṣṭāyasminmukhemukāhāravyollāsaśālitā । (l.2) śmaśāneṣu diganteṣu... evalalanāstanamaśvahirā...dyate kālelaghupiṇḍa ivājasaḥ । keśakarjaladhāriṇyoduspaśālocana priyāḥ । (l.3) duṣkṛtaragniśikha...ryodahantī traṇavannaraṃ śailātpiviśśayyanteśīryante tārakā api । śuṣyantyapisamudrāścayuvopya...vat vanaḥ । evaṃ (l.4)
vicārya vaira..gamupeyādeva kṛtenakarmaṇākṛto nityasiddhāntharūpomokṣo na saṃbhavati na...krataḥ kṛteneti..... । nanu (l.5) kathamapiśrutavi..takādagnihotrādeva । devanaḥparamaṃ śreya iti cetnarhiśruti śirohavihi tatvāttadanupādāne cā brahmaṇyaṃ śrūyate (l.6) śarīrātmātimāninaḥ vajrasūcyāṃ vigavanuśarīramadaṇadṛthanā devot bhataṃ vidrāṣetanmannirayameva mūtradvāreṇaniṣkrāntamiti ihacedavedīdatha (l.7) satyamasti va cedihāvedinmahati vinaṣṭiniti mahāhāni śravaṇāt tametaṃ vedānuvacanena brahmaṇā vividiṣantiyajñeneki
