(i.9b, l.1)
...vidhimevātramanyante sudhīyaḥpare । viktādirāgajanitaśākarahitassādhakaḥ kṛśrācaraṇānantaraṃ vakṣyamāṇāṣṭaśrāddhāni madhyānhe (l.2) vai..vadevāntekṣatodakai śrāddhodadiṣṭadevatāstarpayitvā saṃkalpavidhināśrārdhaṃ kuryāt dāhyāyaṇāśvalāyana sūtriṇāmaṃ yanmemātetyādi (l.3) mantrohanādyatāvākte .. vāpārṣaṇamiti..cikāmanyante tadasāyaṃ śrārdhadevasvarūpamāha । brahmaviṣṇumaheśāñca deva (l.4) brahmavikānapi । kṣatrarṣīn vasurudrādityāṃcāpi sanakādikārya cakṣurādinikaraṇānyathāpi patravargakaṃ । mātravargātmavargau ca (l.5) tarpayecśārdha pūrvataḥ । tathā ca parivrājakaśrutau atha devarṣidivyamanuṣyatūtaphatramātrātmetyaṣṭaśrāddhāni kuryāditi tadatravivariṣyate prathamaṃ (l.6) satyavasusaṃjñikaviśevadevāḥ brahmaviṣṇumaheśvarādaive devarṣibrahmarṣikṣatrarṣaya ārṣe । vasurudrādityādivye । sanakasanandanasanatkumārāmānuṣe । (l.7) prathivyādi pañcahūtāni cakṣurādīndriyāṇicatuṣiyahūtagrāmañcabhautike । pitrapitāmahaprapitāmahāḥ pitre mātravitāmahīpravitā
(i.10a, l.1)
mahyomātraśrāddhe । ātmāntarātmaparamātmāna ātmaśrāddhe cārādhaniyāḥ । evamādāvakṣatodakenasantapyasaṃkalpanidhinā śrārdhaṃ kuryāt । śrāddhavidhānamāha । (l.2) grahamārgatyarvmavakalpamadāghau ghapraśāntaye । avidyāmocanadvārā śivaprāṇaptyaśivaṃkaraṃ । sannyāsaṃ parahaṃsākhyaṃ svikariṣya iti rayanna । (l.3) tadaṃgamṛṣṭaśrāddhānikariṣya iti coccarān । satyavasvātmakāviśve devānāndīmukhāssamṛtāḥ daivānītidaivaśrāddhānyatastilodakāpasavyādivarja...(l.4) tvākṣatrodakādyanuṣṭedhamiti । varjyamāvāhanañcāghaṃ tathāgnaukaraṇaṃ punaḥ । spraṇannaṃguṣṭhamevā...drādaṃguṣṭhamantrataḥ । āvāhanā (l.5) tatra tayaṃ hutvā sanādihirarcayitvāṃ na pariyeṣakānte maguṣṭhamātraḥ puriṣoṃguṣṭhañca samanśritaḥ prabha..ṇāti viśivabhuk iti japvā(l.6)... śivavādāta...śivobhokā śivassarvamidajagaditi śivārpaṇaṃ kuryāt ...sūktāni bhuktautu śivabhāvanaryāyutaḥ । piṇjāndadyāt bhojanāntesvāhā (l.7) nama iti kramāt । sūktānirāvāsyādyupaniṣadaḥ paṭhanu śivabradhyaitān bhojayitvāteṣvā cānteṣutattadvarganāmānyuccārya triktrīnyapiṇḍānnidadhyāt ।
(i.10b, l.1)
brahmannayaṃ piṇḍassāhānarmaviṣṇo iti kramāt praragagreṣudarbheṣvakṣatodakenadaivatityena dadyādityarthaḥ । paredraḥ karmaśeṣārdhaṃ saptamakaśānvinākhlipadhatvāpunasnātvāśuciḥ pratrāyasarvaśaḥ । sadyaḥprayojanamṛtedadrāt saṣasvamātmanaḥ । paredrārṣakṣyamāṇā..ṣṭhānasidhyandhamaṃgulimātrot (l.2) pānasuksarṣatāyaike śakalāvarjaṃvapanasnānopavīta pañcagabhādasaṃ skratassādhakaḥ tatkālesvācāryajakvit brāhmaṇadakṣiṇā vittamasanā (l.3) kasmaicidāyāhāyadadyāt devatāyatanagrāmanadigoṣvavaneṣu vā । kṛtvābrahmāñjalinjannanya eme mantramuccaran । brahmendrasūrya(l.4) somātmajñānasatyaṃ satārakaṃ । devālayādiśucisthale dakṣiṇajānunyastavāmoktānapāṇau dvidarbhikurcaṃ nidhāyadakṣiṇenapidhāya (l.5) oṃ brahmaṇe namaḥ evamindrasūryasomantmajñānasatyākhyasaptamantrānjapet । sāyānvogniṃ pratiṣṭhāpyakuryāddhākhenapasaṃ hṛtiṃ । hutvājyāhutimātmādimantraissattuṃ (l.6) bṛtaṃ pibet sayamagniṃ pratiṣṭhāpya svaśākhādyantamaṇantranagnimīlaityādi bhiṣāvyāhṛtīhiśca athavoṃhūsvāheti brahmādhānato vā (l.7) hutvopariṣṭatnantraṃ samāpya ātmane namaḥ paramātmane namaḥ iti trivāraṃ saktu muṣṭiṃ tathācapayañcājyakaṇikāḥ prāgniyāt tataśśākhopasaṃharaṇaprakāraḥ ।
(i.11a, l.1)
oṃ hūssāvatrīṃ praveśadhāmitat savitureṇyaṃ oṃ bhuvassāvitriṃ praveśayāmitargodevasyadhīmahi oṃ suvaḥ sāvitrīṃ praveśayāmi (l.2) dhimayāmayānamapracodayāt oṃ bhurbhuvassuvassāvitriṃ praveśayāmitat saviturvareṇyaṃ bhargodevasyadhīmahi dhiyoyonaḥ pracodayāt । (l.3) athāgyaṃktarataḥ kṛṣṇājinesthitvapyudarlamukhaḥ । ātmabodhapurāṇāni śruṇuyājjāgaranniśi । agneruttarataḥ kāṣāyakamaṇḍuludaṇḍādisādhanāni (l.4) pratiṣṭhāpya tatra vā dakṣiṇato vā svayaṃ sthitvāsvaruvabenayakapurāṇaṃ śruṇuyāt athoṣasipunasnānādyakhilaṃ svavidhānataḥ । (l.5) virajāhutimantreṇa vaṃśatyājyāhutiścaret prāṇāyetyādipa..picaruṇācaghratoca । upasthāyāgnimājighredyātegna iti mantrataḥ । (l.6) atha snānādiprātarāhutya nantara...kalahomavaiśvadevādi vidhāyatasminnājyābhāgānte carūṇāghṛtenaca virajāmaṇantraḥ prāṇāhutimaṇtra(l.7) ..tvā samāpya brahmācāryadakṣiṇāndadyāt tathā ca śrutiḥ athācamya sadakṣiṇaṃ vastraṃ svakṣapātranthenandatvāsamāpya brahmodvāvanamiti । upasthāyetyatra (l.8) vi....la...ścaktapurṣakamagniprārthanamitigamyate । āvivāhādāsannāsārcāmaraṇādevamevakuryānnaropaṇannāpyavaropaṇamityāhabhagavān
(i.11b, l.1)
...iti vacanāt brahmacārisnātakānāṃlaukikāgni... dhiyate । varṇanassamidādhānaṃghnātakasratanatat bhavet । aupāsanāgnirgrahiṇo (l.2) ..dhurāṇāṃ tathāviyaḥ । sarveṣāṃ kramasanyāsenahomobhidyate kvacit । brahmacārisnātakayorekāgnimatvāviśeṣepi brahmasāriṇassama(l.3)dādhānakatu snātakasyeti grahiṇāmaupāsanāgniḥ vidhurāṇāmekāgninātognividhurāgnireva sarṣeṣāmapakramasanyāse svasvāgnirevahidyate । (l.4) navirajāmantra.....hāma ityarthaḥ sanmā...ñcantaviti svāgnimupasthāyavidhānataḥ । ayanteyonimantreṇanijāśyāropaṇaṃ (l.5) bhavet । sanmāsiñcantu maritassamindrassaṃbrahaspatiḥ sanmāyamagnissiñcatvā yuṣāca balenacāyukṣantaṃ karotumetyupasthāya ayuntayoniriti (l.6) mantreṇāgnimadhvayuśarya....namāghrāpayediti prajyate । ....śrutauhi tatraikeprājāpatyeṣṭiṃ kuryāsadutathānakuryā dāgneyīmeva (l.7) kuryāt agnirhiprāṇaḥ prāṇamevaitayākarotīti prāṇaḥ paramātmā etayāgneyūṣṭyāprāṇaṃ paramātmānaṃ prāṣotītyā papaktinnirduśya paścākte yātaviṣṭiṃ
(i.12a, l.1)
vidhāyāyante yonirityāropamantramukvāgrāmādagnimāhṛtya pūrvavadagnimādhrāpayediti śrutisāmartyāṃ niragnikaviṣaya iti । tata ekāgnividhunatretāgni (l.2) vidhurabrahmacārisnātakānāmayante yoniritimantreṇāgnisamārope viśeṣaḥ । athāgnyalābhepseva vaiṣāṃhomastanmantrato bhavet । (l.3) yathāgnaukaraṇaṃ tadvat bhavedevaśrute bu..t । kenāpi hetunālaukikāgnyalābherpsukaṭāhajaleṣujuhuyāt dauktamantrata iti yadyagninnavindetāpsujuhuyāt (l.4) āpovaisarvādevatā ssarvābhyo devatābhyo juhomisvāheti hutvā dhṛtyaprāgniyāditi śrutiḥ । atha praiṣavidhānaṃ (l.5) vyāhṛtiḥ praṇavāṃgeṣu vilāpya....yektakaḥ । asaṃvṛkṣasyayaścandomantrātyāṃ prayatomanaṃ । pramavāṃgeṣvakārādiṣutisrovyāhṛtiḥ (l.6) pravilāpyapraṇavākāraṃ brahmāhaṃ vṛkṣasyaneriveti yaścandasāmṛṣabhaiti ca prārthayet । oṃ bhūssannyastamityādi preṣamantraṃ kramo...taṃ । (l.7) datvābhayañjalaṃ prāśya...khāmuścidya sūtrakaṃ upavītaṃ brahiritikṣipet vyāhṛti..rjale । kaṭisūtraṃ tataścitvājātarūpatharaścaret । oṃ bhūssanyastaṃ mayā (l.8) oṃ bhūva...yā oṃ suvaḥ ... oṃ bhūrbhuvasvaḥ ... iti mandamadhyamatāratā napyutakṛmatassamuccaret । tataḥ putreṣaṇāvarteṣaṇādanareṣaṇābhyovyukthite ।
(i.12b, l.1)
smitipratijñāya abhayaṃ sarvabhūtebhyo maktasvāheti culakodakaṃ nipīdhācamyaśikhāṃ praṇavenaścitvā visṛjyata. (l.2) upavītantāreṇonamucyabahi...nivasetvamantaḥ praviśyamadhyehyajasraṃ paramaṃ pavitraṃ athobalaṃjñānavairāgyamedhāssatvasyaśuddhiṃ satatanmeprayaśceti (l.3) śrutyuktavidhināścitvā praṇavenajalakṣipet kaṭisūtrādivisṛjyajātarūpadharaḥ sadābālyenatiṣṭhāsediti śruteḥ jātamātraśiśuvatgotra (l.4) sūtraśātravādivibhāgaśyanya udicīndiśaṃ gaścet । śrutiścavidārnapraiṣāccāraṇaṃ kṛtvāpraṇavādhaikadhyānaparāyaṇassannabhayaṃ sarvabhūtebhyo maktasvāhe (l.5) ...bāhussarbutvā brahmāhama..dīvandiśāgaścerjātarūpadharaścarediti turyātītāvadhūtapakṣamanasinidhāyāvocat । athavā daṇḍavasanakhaṇḍakuṇḍiparigrahaḥ । (l.6) kārya ācāryamutesvavairāgyānsārataḥ । atha vā uktalakṣaṇavairāgyābhāve svacittaparipākānusāreṇa gurumukhātaktadvaktibhedala (l.7) lakṣaṇalakṣitopakaraṇāni prāpnayādavaparantvatītava-ktirevamukhyā śrīyate hi atha tadadhikārinabhavedyadigrahasthaprārthanā prarṣaṃsakhāmegopāyeti daṇḍādi (l.8) gṛhitvā gurusannidhaupraṇavamahāvākyāsyopadeśaṃ prāpyavedāntaśravamaḥ kuryāt । brahmāṇḍañca hitvākaupināścādanadaṇḍādi svaśarirojya
(i.13a, l.1)
kārāyalokopakārāyaca parigrahektaccanamukhyosti punaḥkomukhya iti cennadaṇḍaṃ nakaupīnamityādi śruteḥ atītāśramaevābhiprāyaḥ (l.2) asalokedheparāparavidyāvantomahāntaścalokaśivaṃkarāḥ kṛpaṇasyajanasyācāryabhāvamupetyasaṃpradāya vidyāpradarśanāyavaidikavarṇāśramadharmaṃ bodhayituṃ (l.3) pravarttante । teṣāmācāryavarāṇāṃ yadyatpitāṃ barrathagajaturagapīṭhaścatracāmaramajūṣādūtabhaṭabhratya vā ditrādilokopakārakaṃ nātmakāmabho (l.4) gārhaśca bhavitavyamevatadevalovadikaṃ ...rathāsyalokasyāyamīdraśa iti mahāpuruṣacaraṇaprapatanaṃ tvanu bhavet । nanu kaupinayugalaṃ kandhādaṇḍa ekaḥ (l.5) parigrahaḥ yakṣoparamahaṃ sasyanādhikantu vidhiyata iti vacasādhikapanigrahe pratyavāyaśravaṇāccakayaṃ yānaścatrādisaṃpaditicet satyaṃ yathāvividiṣā sanyāsasyavi..t (l.6) sannayāsalakṣaṇasarvatyāgadharmasaṃkocatvaṃ ekasyamuktihetave tathā prajābahulasyakramamukyarthamiśavarājayā kṛtāvatārāṇāṃ śrīśaṃkarabhagavat (l.7) pādavidyāsaṃpradāyakagururoṇāṃ bahujanottaranaṇasādhanatvena yā dinādisaṃpat vihitā yathā rājāmamṛgayādinā devendrodriśikṣayā sṛṣṭāviṣamasṛṣyā
(i.13b, l.1)
harirasunavadhena rudrassarvasaṃhāreṇaca na diṣyante । kiñca īśavarājyadhiyāpāpānya pikarmāṇi su vṛtāḥbhavanti pratānyajyantaṃ satyameva na saṃśaya iti । (l.2) ākāśavanmāna vidugohakādisabhāsya vilakṣaṇohaṃ āhāyyavannityavaniścalohamaṃbhodhivat pāravivarjitohamitisvarūpaniścayavatānteṣāntejo viśeṣeṇa (l.3) pratyavādhena vidyata iti nyāyena jānādiparigraho lokān graha eva parantu sṛgagajamālyāṅganākala.. mayutāṃ btalādyātmakāmyājyānye vetyadhaḥ । (l.4) daṇḍalakṣaṇamāha –
daṇḍantu vaiṇavaṃsaumyasitvacaṃ samavarṣakaṃ nāsādaghnaṃ śirastulyaṃ ..voṣā... bibhrayādyatiḥ । pādādimastakapramāṇamavṛṇaṃ (l.5) salaṃ saumyamakākapraṣṭhaṃ salakṣaṇavaiṇandaṇḍamekamācamana pūrvakaṃ sakhamegopāyojassakhāyosi indrasya vajrosivārkraghnaśśarmamegavayat । (l.6) pāpantannivārayeti daṇḍaṃ paragrahediti śruteḥ । nāgamudrāyenumudrā vastrakhaṇḍena daṇḍake dhāryāparaśumudrāca mūlamadhyāgrataḥ kramāt । atra paraśumudrāsarvaiṣiditaiva tadayaḥ brahmamudrāyen mudrānāgamudrāśaṃkhamudrāca catasra upa...pariveṣṭanagrandhibhedena vartate tāssaṃpradāyakrameṇa veditavyāḥ āhatya (l.7) mudrāpaścakamasti ata eva pañcamudrālasardaṇḍaṃ bibhaktigururāraśiva iti ekādaśarudrasaṃhitāyāṃ jagajjīvanamanteṇa kuṇḍakāṃ praṇave na ca ।
(i.14a, l.1)
ka...sūtrādikamavigra... hīyāt guruvākyataḥ । jagajajivananjīvanādhārabhūtaṃ māte māmantrayasva sarvadāsarvasaumyeti maṇḍulaṃ praṇavena (l.2) ka....trakaupīnāścādanayogapaṭṭādīn parigrahediti śrutiḥ evaṃ sādhanavānyogī brahmavidyāguruṃ vṛjet । mahāvākyārtha tatvajño brahmāṇa..tya (l.3) parobhavet । spaṣṭaḥ athāhi tāgniviṣayaḥ । āhitāgnirathāgneyaṃ paścāktedhātavimapi । iṣṭiṃ kuryāt praṇimāsatantreṇānyacca varjayet । (l.4) āhitāgniviṣaye āgneyūtredhātaviṣṭyoḥ karaṇaṃ praṇimāsatantreṇa pātraprayogakāle ...kavalāni anyāhāryasthāli.. varjaṃbhutarapātrārṇaprakṛtivat (l.5) niṣṭāpaṇetadedavatāyai juṣṭamiti kapālopadhāne dvitiye caturthaṣaṣṭhāṣṭamānānmantraṇāmāvṛktiḥ yajñohi ayaṃ yajñaḥ (l.6) mamāśe caturhotanya agnayenurbuhi agniṃ yaja agnaya idaṃ agnerahandeva yajyadhā na pārvaṇahomaḥ । nāriṣṭhān sviṣṭakṛtaṃ hutvāvirajya prāśitraṃ (l.7) caturdhākaraṇe svamātrabhāgasarvasva ikṣiṇāṃ datvā yajñobabhuva yajñaśañcameti varjaṃ iṣṭiṃ samāpyāhavanīye dāriprātrāṇi pu...dautaijasā.
